# Intentionally no keys.
#
# pnpm-only install settings (node-linker, auto-install-peers, ...) are not
# applied from this file by the pinned pnpm (12.16.1); they belong in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml. The previous `node-linker=hoisted` and
# `auto-install-peers=false` lines were silently ignored — `pnpm-lock.yaml`
# records `autoInstallPeers: true` and the installed tree is `isolated` — so
# they were removed instead of migrated: moving them would change the install
# layout and require a lockfile regeneration.
#
# npm-generic keys (registry, //registry/:_authToken, ...) still work here.
